<% case level %>
<% when "beginner" %>
- Use CEFR A1-A2 English: basic vocabulary, mostly present tense, about 10 words per sentence.
- Keep each reply to 1-2 short sentences and ask only one question at a time.
<% when "intermediate" %>
- Use CEFR B1-B2 English: natural everyday expressions, a few common phrasal verbs.
- Keep each reply to 2-3 sentences.
<% when "advanced" %>
- Use CEFR C1 English: natural native-level expressions, including idioms and nuance.
<% end %>
